# Dev browser authentication

**Sources:** [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) (Dev authentication section).

On **`npm run dev`** only (`APP_ENV=local`, not `IS_E2E`), sign in via **`GET /api/dev-login`** with `email`, `password`, and optional `redirect` (defaults match seeded admin; use values from your `.env` after `npm run db:seed`).

**Do not** use this route in Playwright specs that test **`/login`**, sign-up, or email/password UI — e2e disables the shortcut (`IS_E2E=1`); keep [`signInAsAdmin`](../../tests/helpers/e2e-admin-sign-in.ts) and form flows in [`Auth.e2e.ts`](../../tests/e2e/Auth.e2e.ts).
